---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
description: "NAEYC accredited child care and early learning in Plainfield, New Jersey. Infants through school age, two locations, serving families since 1998."
---

{% set active = announcements | activeAnnouncements %}
{% if active.length %}
  <div class="announcement">
    <div class="wrap">
      {% for item in active %}
        <p class="announcement__title">{{ item.title }}</p>
        <p>{{ item.body }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
{% endif %}

{# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hero #}
<section class="hero hero--split">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Plainfield, New Jersey</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">
        Precious Steps has cared for Plainfield's children since
        {{ site.foundedYear }}. Accredited, state rated, and small enough that
        we know every child by name.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary button--lg" href="{{ site.primaryCta.href }}">{{ site.primaryCta.label }}</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary button--lg" href="/programs/">See our programs</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__media">
      {% set slotSrc = null %}
      {% set slotRatio = "portrait" %}
      {% set slotLabel = "Children at play in a classroom" %}
      {% include "partials/media-slot.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------ Trust strip #}
<section class="trust">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="trust__list">
      {% for item in site.accreditations %}
        <li class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__name">{{ item.name }}</span>
          <span class="trust__detail">{{ item.detail }}</span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------- Feature: our story #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Since {{ site.foundedYear }}</p>
        <h2>Nearly thirty years of Plainfield families</h2>
        <p>
          We began on the first floor of a two-family home, licensed for
          fifteen children. An early childhood contract with Plainfield Public
          Schools in 2000 let us serve more of our neighbors, and our waiting
          list for infants and toddlers grew past what one building could hold.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today we run two centers, accredited by the National Association for
          the Education of Young Children since 2006 and rated by Grow NJ Kids.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/about/">Read our full story</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature__media">
        {% set slotSrc = null %}
        {% set slotRatio = "landscape" %}
        {% set slotLabel = "The center exterior or a classroom" %}
        {% include "partials/media-slot.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------- Feature: our team #}
<section class="section section--subtle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature feature--reverse">
      <div class="feature__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our teachers</p>
        <h2>Credentialed, bilingual, and here for the long run</h2>
        <p>
          Our lead teachers hold BA, BS and MA degrees with standard Preschool
          through Third Grade certification, and several hold Special Education
          certification. Our associate teachers hold degrees and Child
          Development Associate credentials.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every staff member clears a Child Abuse Record Inquiry and a Criminal
          History Record Inquiry, is trained in CPR and First Aid, and takes
          part in continuous professional development. We have bilingual staff
          at the center.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/about/#our-teachers">Meet the team</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature__media">
        {% set slotSrc = null %}
        {% set slotRatio = "landscape" %}
        {% set slotLabel = "A teacher working with children" %}
        {% include "partials/media-slot.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# -------------------------------------------------------------- Programs #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Programs</p>
      <h2>A classroom for every stage</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Five classrooms, each with its own curriculum and teacher to child
        ratio. High Scope for our youngest children, Connect 4 Learning in
        district Pre-K.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid grid--3 grid--list">
      {% for program in programs %}
        <li>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="card__title">{{ program.name }}</h3>
            <p class="card__meta">{{ program.ages }} &middot; Ratio {{ program.ratio }}</p>
            <div class="card__body">
              {% if program.summary %}
                <p>{{ program.summary }}</p>
              {% else %}
                <div class="todo">
                  <strong>Content needed</strong>
                  {{ program.sourceNote }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <p class="card__link"><a href="/programs/#{{ program.id }}">About {{ program.name }}</a></p>
          </article>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# --------------------------------------------------------- Feature: meals #}
<section class="section section--subtle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meals</p>
        <h2>Breakfast, lunch and snacks, every day</h2>
        <p>
          Meals are provided under the New Jersey Child and Adult Care Food
          Program and meet USDA nutritional standards, with menus posted
          monthly. We practice family style dining, where children and staff
          eat together and children serve themselves.
        </p>
        <p>
          We accommodate food allergies as directed by your child's physician.
          Precious Steps is a nut free center.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature__media">
        {% set slotSrc = null %}
        {% set slotRatio = "landscape" %}
        {% set slotLabel = "Children at the lunch table" %}
        {% include "partials/media-slot.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# -------------------------------------------------------- Photo divider #}
<section class="divider">
  {% set slotSrc = null %}
  {% set slotRatio = "wide" %}
  {% set slotLabel = "Wide photograph of the playground or a full classroom" %}
  {% include "partials/media-slot.njk" %}
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------ Locations + maps #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Visit us</p>
      <h2>Two centers in Plainfield</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Each location runs a different mix of programs and keeps different
        hours. Call either number and we will point you to the right one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for location in site.locations %}
        <article class="location">
          {% include "partials/location-map.njk" %}

          <div class="location__body">
            <h3 class="location__name">{{ location.name }}</h3>
            <address class="location__address">
              {{ location.street }}<br />
              {{ location.city }}, {{ location.state }} {{ location.zip }}
            </address>
            <dl class="spec">
              <dt>Phone</dt>
              <dd><a href="tel:{{ location.phone | phoneHref }}">{{ location.phone | phoneDisplay }}</a></dd>
              <dt>Hours</dt>
              <dd>{{ location.hours }}</dd>
              <dt>Calendar</dt>
              <dd>{{ location.calendar }}</dd>
            </dl>
            {% if not location.addressConfirmed or not location.programsConfirmed %}
              <div class="todo">
                <strong>Unconfirmed</strong>
                Address, hours, calendar or program mix for this location is
                pending client confirmation. See CONTENT-STATUS.md.
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            <p><a href="/locations/#{{ location.id }}">More about {{ location.name }}</a></p>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------ Testimonials #}
<section class="section section--subtle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Families</p>
      <h2>What parents say</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="todo">
      <strong>Content needed</strong>
      The client is approaching parents for testimonials. Each one needs the
      parent's written permission to publish, along with a first name or
      initials. Until then this section stays out of the launch build.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
